<title>SPAIN: Spanish bonds end unchanged, looking at BoS' repo.</title>
<headline>Spanish bonds end unchanged, looking at BoS' repo.</headline>
<text>
<p>1610 GMT - Bonos end unchanged as early gains lose momentum and prices dragged down by other mkts. Focus on Friday's repo * 10-yr 7.35 pct T-bond 104.04 vs 103.88, yield 6.68 vs 6.66 * March future 114.61 vs 114.64 at yesterday's end. * Peseta/mark 84.69/72 vs 84.64/66</p>
